<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Tutsa: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="h">Ephisiate</para>
  <para style="toc1">EPHISIATE suh Pool ih raang arah Le</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephisiate</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eph</para>
  <para style="mt1">EPHISIATE</para>
  <para style="mt2">Suh Pool Ih Raang Arah Le</para>
  <para style="imt">Ephangjatjih</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Pool ih Ephisiate suh le maatta </char> adi jaakhothoon ah Rangte kaankoong tiit ah raangha, jirep dongsiitta dowa loong ah eroom ih angsuh ah, nyia jirep ah rang nyia hah dowa loong Kristo ah lamsuite ang ano eroom ih angsuh ah.” (1.10). Eno Jisu Kristo damdoh esiit ih hoon eno mina jaat loongtang jutsiit jangsiit angtheng ngeh ih Rangte mina loong lasih uh joot eha.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Ephisiate</char> leedap ni jaakhothoon raangte wah rah ih jutsiit jangsiit tiit ah baat ha, erah langla seng loong Wah Rangte ih heh mina loong danjeeha jun ih baat ha nyia neng loong rangdah ah biin anaan mamah hoonha adoleh heh Sah Jisu Kristo jun ih rangdah nawa mamah puipangta, adoleh Esa Chiiala nawa ih Rangte kakham elong ah choh jaatjaat ih ah ngeh ih baat ha. Erah lih adi arah le wette loong asuh Kristo mendoh esiit ih hoonli ngeh ih baat ha ah neng roidong doh amiimi angtheng ngeh ih baat ha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jengkhaap ehanko ah Rangte mina loong ah Kristo damdoh roop eno esiit angtheng ngeh ih baat ha: Chaas ah mina sakpuh likhiik, adoleh Kristo ah lamsuite; adoleh nok ni thonghong likhiik; adoleh hesawah damdi hesanuh likhiik. Arah le raangte ah Kristo damdi Rangte minchan jeela jun ih baattaan ha. Jirep aju Kristo minchan ni, mina raangtaan ih tiita, biin anaan hoonha, minchan jeela nyia heh esa thoon angla adi japtup hi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Hemong Dowa Jatjih</para>
  <para style="io1">Ephangjatjih<char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo nyia chaas<char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3—3:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo ni roidong na<char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1—6:20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ethoon ni<char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Esm 18:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref> </char>
    </note>Arah le ah Pool taangnawa, Rangte tenthun jun ih Jisu Kristo kaamwah ih hoonte wah rah ah—</para>
  <para style="p">Ephisia ni tongte Rangte mina,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mararah le ni amuh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Iphisa ni ngeh ah.</char></note> Kristo Jisu damdi roongroop rum ano neng laalom di rongtangtang ih songtongla loong asuh:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Seng loong Wah Rangte nyia Teesu Jisu Kristo ih sen suh minchan toom kohan nyia semroongroong ih toom songtong thuk han.</para>
  <para style="s">Kristo jiinni Chiiala romseetam jeela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Seng Teesu Jisu Kristo Wah Rangte suh lakookmi li ih! Tiimnge liidi Kristo damdi roongroop eno arah mongrep adi rangmong dowa chiiala romseetam ah kohali. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Arah mongrep ah maang dongsiitka diidook, seng loong ah esa nyia heh ngathong nah lamoongtaang suh, Kristo damdoh roongroop eno heh mina angthuk suh Rangte ih jen danje ih tahe.</para>
  <para style="p">Heh minchan je thoidi, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Rangte<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">heh ngathong ni. Heh minchan je thoidi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">heh gnathong ni, nyia minchan nah tong theng. Rangte. </char></note> ih seng loong ah Jisu Kristo jun ih hesuh hesah ih hoon suh jen thuntak eta—erah langla heh tenroon theng nyia heh raangtaan ih angta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Rangte ih heh minchan elong nyia heh mongnook Sah thaangmuh lakkot ih kohali, erah raangtaan ih heh rangphoong ih! <verse number="7" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kol 1:14</ref></char></note> Tiimnge liidi Kristo sih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kristo sih ih ba; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kristo tek tungkaangdi ba. </char></note> ih ba, seng loong ah maama pongwan jen angthuk hali, erah langla seng rangdah ah biin anaan hali. Rangte minchan ah tiimthan elongthoon ah, <verse number="8" style="v"/>erah minchan ah lajen thaakbaat theng kohali!</para>
  <para style="p">Heh tenthun nyia mongtham thoontang nawa ih <verse number="9" style="v"/>Rangte kaankoong tiimjih angta heh erah reeta, eno Kristo jun ih husah ni tiimjih thoon mookaat thunta erah kaankoong ah dongjat thuk hali. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Eno erah chungha ah saapoot thok ha doh re ah, heh kaankoong ah langla, rangmong nyia arah hah adi mathan dongsiitta erah loong ah eroom ih khoonsiit thung, eno eradoh Kristo ah heh khoh ang ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Jaatrep ah Rangte kaankoong nyia mongtham jun ih angla; erah raangtaan ih jaakhoh diidook thunta jun ih Kristo damdi roopthuk heeno heh mina angsuh danje tahe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, Kristo suh jaakhoh phang laalomte loong ah ih Rangte chaan ah phoongpha ih!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Eno amiisak tiitkhaap chaattan dowa ih Rangte mina ih hoontan, erah langla sen khopi thukte Ruurang Ese tiit angdowa. Sen loong ah ih Kristo ah hanpi kanno, Rangte ih heh thoomhoon kakham jun ih, Esa Chiiala nawa ih sen sak ni changte sin ah thong tahan. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Heh mina loong suh Rangte ih kakhamta jun ih Chiiala ah seng ih choh jaatjaat etheng, erah laalomli thoidoh Rangte ih heh mina loong ah maama pongwan angthuk ah. Heh rangka ah phoongpha ih!</para>
  <para style="s">Pool rangsoom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Emah ang thoidi,Teesu Jisu Kristo suh tuumaang nyia Rangte mina loong minchan tan phangchaat tang dowa ih, <verse number="16" style="v"/>sen loong raangtaan ih Rangte suh lakookmi li tatoi kang. Sen loong ah nga rangsoom ni samthun roh ih rumhala <verse number="17" style="v"/>eno seng Teesu Jisu Kristo, chaan aphaan Wah Rangte asuh, Chiiala kotthuk suh sen raangtaan ih suh roh ehang, sen suh mongtham ese ah jatthuk suh nyia Rangte tupthuk suh ah. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nga rangsoom ah langla heh weephaak ah sen thung nah jeeroh toom ih ah, tiimnge liidoh sen tiim raangtaan ih poon tahan erah laalom tiit ah toomjat an suh ah, heh mina suh romseetam kot suh kakhamta tiit ah tiimthan elong ah, <verse number="19" style="v"/>eno heh hanpiite loong damdi chaan aphaan wakroop hala ah tiimthan rak ah. Seng damdi wakmokah hala chaan aphaan ah thoonrakla, <verse number="20" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Rsb 110:1</ref></char></note> erah chaan aphaan nawa ih Kristo ah etek nawa ngaaksaat thuk ano rangmong nawa mongrep ni heh Wah reeni jaawah ko tongthukla. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Rangmong dowa phansiitte loong, ngoong awang, ehang echaan nyia teesu loong ah Kristo ih pan rumha; thoontang khodi elong men chaan aphaan ah arah mongrep ni luulu lah angthang ih liwang doh uh emamah ang ah. <verse number="22" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Rsb 8:6</ref></char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1:18</ref> </char></note>Rangte ih jirep ah Kristo lakhui ni angthukla eno chaas ni heh jirep adi Teesu angla. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Chaas ah Kristo sakpuh, jirep ah nyia noongrep ni hesaksak ni roopla.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">jirep ah nyia noongrep ni; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">o heteteewah Rangte thanthan angta </char></note></para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Etek nawa roidong tiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:13">Kol 2:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Teewadi sen rangdah nyia laboichaat thoidi sen loong ah chiiala ni tekmang angtan. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Erah tokdi arah mongrep dowa ethih ekhah lam ah phantan; sen loong ah ih rangwaatdam dowa ethih chiiala pante loong jeng kaptan, amadi uh Rangte jeng laboichaatte loong ah erah chiiala rah ih pan rumha. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Amiimiidi seng loong ah seng hansi ih jen thoidi neng likhiik ih songtongti, seng hansi raangtaan ih tiim jamti nyia tiim thunti erah jun ih songtongti. Hansi nah jaatjaat mok tongthaati bah Rangte tenkhat ah seng sak nah angtheng taha, wahoh loong sak ni angla likhiik ah:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Enoothong Rangte minchan ah erathan ehan adoleh heh mongnook ah erathan ih rakla, <verse number="5" style="v"/>heh jeng laboichaat thoidi chiiala ni tekmang laang angti bah uh Kristo damdi ngaakthing ih thuk hali. Rangte minchan je tungkaangdi ba seng loong ah puipang hali. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Rangmong nawa mongrep nah roongtong suh Kristo Jisu damdi roongroop thuk heeno seng uh ngaaksaat ih thuk hali. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Erah langla, Jisu Kristo jun ih seng minchan hali ah liwang nah uh heh minchan ah hedakdak rakla ngeh ih saarookwet raang ih noisok suh minchan hali. <verse number="8-9" style="v"/>Tiimnge liidi Rangte minchan ih ba sen tuumaang jun ih pui lan. Erah senchaan senphaan nawa ih tah angka, erabah Rangte lakkot, erah suh o uh tajen khuupookka. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Rangte ih seng mamah ah erah likhiik ih dongsiit tahe, eno Jisu Kristo damdi roongroop eno seng roidong doh mootse kaatse pakna suh dongsiit tahe, marah pakna heh ih seng suh reethuk suh jenban khookham thiin eta rah ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Kristo mendi esiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Sen dongtup tahan dowa ih sen loong ah Ranglajatte—Jehudi loong ih “khoopkhan muh” ngeh ih men halan, neng teewah suh baleh khoopkhan choi ih liiha (neng sakpuh nah miwah ih tiim etheng ah erah toobaat ha)—ehakdi mamah angtan erah samthun ih an. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Erah tokdi sen Kristo reenawa haloh angtan. Sen loong ah mideek mikaante angtan nyia Rangte ih danje han rah mina tah angtan. Heh mina loong suh kakhamta jun ih, sen loong ah kakham jengdang adi taroop tan, eno arah mongrep adi sen loong ah laalom muh nyia Rangte muh ih tongtan. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Enoothong, amadi, sen loong ah haloh angtan loong ah Kristo Jisu damdi roongroop anno Kristo sih jun ih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kristo sih jun ih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kristo ih heh tek haatthuk thoidi.</char></note> heh reeni thoksiit halan. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tiimnge liidi Kristo heh teeteewah ih Jehudi nyia Ranglajatte loong ah phoosiit hoonthuk heeno semroongroong ih tongthuk hali. Seng loong ah seng jaachi ni koiraangthuk tangchook ah likhiik piiara ih tongti eno erah heh sakpuh ih thet haatta. <verse number="15" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Kol 2:14</ref></char></note> Jehudi Hootthe ni jengdang nyia banlam hantek angta loong ah heh ih matsiitta, erah langla heh teewah damdoh roongroop ano Jehudi nyia Ranglajatte loong ah jaatsiit paatsiit esiit eh hoonthuk suh ah, neng jaachi ni semroongroong emah dong angthuk rumta. <verse number="16" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1:20</ref></char></note> Kristo ih heh roidong ah bangphak khoni tekthuk thoidi neng jaachi ni piiara ih tong rumta ah matsiitta; bangphak jun ih neng changnyi ah sakpuh esiit ni roopthuk ano Rangte reeni ngaaksiit rum taha. <verse number="17" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa 57:19</ref></char></note> Semroongroong Ruurang tiit ah Kristo ih loongtang suh baattaan tahan—erah langla Ranglajatte o Rangte reenawa haloh ni angtan loong suh baat tahan, adoleh Jehudi mina o heh reeni angtan loong suh baat tahan. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Eno seng loong ah Jehudi angkojio adoleh Ranglajatte angkojio, Kristo jun ih ba heh Wah reeni Chiiala esiit ni jen thok hali.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, Ranglajatte sen loong ah mideekte nyia dookdate takah angkan; aanoobah Rangte mina nyia Rangte changka ih hoonlan. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Sen loong ah uh nok hoon ah likhiik, kaamwah nyia khowah loong ih thong phangchapta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kaamwah nyia khowah loong ih thong phangchapta</char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">thong ah langla, kamwah nyia khowah neng loongloong ah</char></note> di roong rooplan, erah di thonghong ah langla Kristo Jisu heh teeteewah. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Erah ah ju heh teewah nok thoontang ah roopjoh ano Teesu rangsoomnok esa ih dongtoon chap thukte rah ah. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Heh damdi roongroop thuk hanno sen loong ah nep erah nok adi wahoh loong damdi wakroop thuk halan, maradi Chiiala ni Rangte tongla adi ah.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ranglajatte loong raang ih Pool mootkaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Emah ang thoidi, ngah, Pool, Ranglajatte sen loong thoilam di Kristo Jisu mendi phaatak ni tong angno, rangsoom hang. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Amiimiidi, sen ih echaat etan heh minchan di Rangte ih sen loong raang ih ese angsuh arah reethuk halang. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Rangte ih husah ni kaankoongta ah ngasuh jat ih thuk halang. (Arah tiit ah amasah raangkoh rumhala, <verse number="4" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26">Kol 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="COL 1:27">27</ref></char></note> eno erah raanghang ah weh anno, Kristo husah tiit ngah ih jat hang ah sen ih jen jat ih an.) <verse number="5" style="v"/>Jaakhoni mina suh arah husah tiit ah tabaatta, enoothong amadi esa khowah nyia kaamwah loong asuh Chiiala jun ih Rangte ih dongjat et thuk rumha. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Husah tiit ah langla ruurang ese jun ih Ranglajatte loong ah uh Jehudi damdi romseetam ah roongchoh ih rumha; neng loong ah wasiit sakpuh ni changkaasiit ih hoonrum ano Kristo Jisu jun ih kakhamta adi roongroop ih rumla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Rangte lakkot ah hoondak ih kohangno, ruurang ese raang ih ngah heh laksuh ih hoonthuk tahang, erah langla ruurang ese tiit baat angdi hechaan hephaan lam ih mokalang. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Rangte mina loong changdi ngah ehinthoon, ang abah uh arah mootkaat saapoot ese ah Rangte ih Ranglajatte loong suh Ruurang Ese tiit nyia Kristo lajen rookwetjih tiit ah baattaan suh kohalang, <verse number="9" style="v"/>nyia Rangte husah kaankoong ah mamah moottheng ah erah thoontang mina suh noisok thuk halang. Jaatrep dongsiitte wah, Rangte ih, heh husah kaankoong ah teewah di, roirep di huthiinta, <verse number="10" style="v"/>tiim esuh hutoota li abah, rangsah loong pante nyia rangmong nawa mongrep ngoong awang loong ih heh mongtham ah jaatrep lamni jeela ngeh ih toom jatrum ah ngeh ih, ahaang dowa chaas jun ih noisok ha. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Rangte erah reeta ah mabah uh lathoonjih heh kaankoong ah jun ih reeta, eno erah seng Teesu Kristo Jisu jun ih reeta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Seng tuumaang jun ih Kristo damdi roop eno, Rangte ngathong ni tuumaangmaang ih naanwang hali. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Erah thoidi, sen raangtaan ih chamnaang lang asuh nak thungjoong an ngeh ih liirum hala, erah chamnaang lang ah langla sen loong ih hedak toom dakchoh an.</para>
  <para style="s">Kristo mongnook</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Erah thoidi, seng Wah ngathong ni nga lakuh ni tong angno kotbon lang, <verse number="15" style="v"/>marah rangmomg nyia hah adi changka rep ih heh amiisak men ah jat rumha wah asuh ah. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ngah ih Rangte seng Wah suh rangsoom hang, sen thung nah heh Chiiala jun ih chaan aphaan toom kohan, heh eseethoon et rangka dowa ah. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Sen tuumaang jun ih Kristo ah senten senmong nah tongruh toom ih ah eno sen loong ah heh minchan nah sen hing toom rongchap an ngeh ih rangsoom koh rumhala, <verse number="18" style="v"/>tiimnge liidoh, Rangte mina ang damdam sen ih Kristo minchan ah tiimthan rak ah, tiimthan choong ah, tiimthan nuuk ah erah loong ah jat suh chaan aphaan toom kohan. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Erah minchan ah ejatju toom ih an— mabah uh thoontang lajen jattheng ang abah uh—sen thung nah Rangte dang ajang likhiik ah toomje ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Rangte chaan aphaan ah seng damdi waktong thoidi, seng ih ehan lajamke ah adoleh lasuke ah, Rangte erah nang ih ehan jen moka ah. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Saapoot rookwet Kristo Jisu nyia chaas nah heh men rangka theng toom ang ah, roitang roijang raang ah! Amen.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sakpuh esiit ni roop tiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih—Ngah, Teesu mootkaat kaatkang ih phaatak ni tongte warah ih baat rumhala: Rangte ih poon tahan eno heh ih poon theethe ih tongtha an. <verse number="2" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Kol 3:12-13</ref></char></note> Sen loong ah saarookwet toongtang ang theng, mise angtheng nyia jirep jen naan ete ang theng. Wasiit ih wasiit jeng naan anno sen minchan ah noisok theng. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Chiiala ni sen loong ah semroongroong ang anno esiit ih jutje lan, eno erah jutje lan ah naririh ih thiin an. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sakpuh nyia chiiala ah esiit angla, erah likhiik Rangte ih uh laalom esiit raang ih poon halan. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Teesu esiit, tuumaang esiit, juutem esiit angla; <verse number="6" style="v"/>thoontang mina raangtaan ih Rangte nyia Hewah esiit, eno heh loongtang raang ih Teesu, loongtang mina jun ih roong mokala nyia loongtang mina damdi tongla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Seng loong esiit esiit suh hoondak lakkot ah Kristo ih thiikmiikta jun ih chothuk hali. <verse number="8" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Rsb 68:18</ref></char></note> Rangteele ni amah liiha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Heh echoong thoon ni du wangta adi,</para>
  <para style="q2">phaatak nawa loong ah hantek siitwanta;</para>
  <para style="q2">heh ih mina loong suh hoondak lakkot ah korumta.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Eno, amadi “heh du wangta” ah tiimjih suh liiha? Erah langla jaakhoh ah arah hamongtang adi ra taha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hamongtang adi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">hah heheh hamongtang.</char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Erah thoidi wasiit wah marah datra taha erah wah wah ah we ngaak duuwangta, rang khothung echoong ni duuwangta, rang nyi hah noongrep nah heh eje totoh angsuh ah. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Heh ih “mina loong asuh hoondak lakkot” ah korumta; heh ih mararah ah kaamwah angthuk suh kheeta, mararah ah khowah angthuk suh kheeta, mararah ah ewangelis angthuk suh, maramarah ah pastor nyia nyootte angthuk suh khe rumta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Erah langla, Rangte mina loong ah Kristaan mootkaat kaat thuk suh khe rumta, Kristo sakpuh chaas ah hakthuk suh ah. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Eno seng loongtang seng tuumaang nyia Rangte Sah men jat hi jun ih esiit ih hoontheng; seng loong ah Kristo angla likhiik maang mi langlang mihak thungsek ih hoontheng. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Erah thoidoh seng noodek likhiik lakah ang theng, mih mokwaante loong ih nyootsoot ha tiit ah chaat eno juutak ih haangko lengmotmot kah eh ah likhiik ah, erah loong ah ih bah neng tenthun ni tiim thunha erah di moong mokwaan kaatla. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Erah nang ebah, moongnook tiitwaan nyia chiiala amiisak tiit ah roongwaan ih no, Kristo ih siit hali lam adoh haktheng, seng lamsiitte ah heh juuba. <verse number="16" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kol 2:19</ref></char></note> Sak asi ni hephaan dowa lak alah adoleh tui akhoh jirep ah heh ih panha jun eroom ih roong roopla, eno sakpuh putang adi hethah hethah ah rooptoom ano esiit ih hoonla. Erah thoidi, sakpuh ni hethah hethah mathan ah erah loong ah o mamah reetheng ah, erah likhiik mokah rum ano minchanmui jun ih sakpuh ah ehak ela.</para>
  <para style="s">Kristo ni roidong ena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Erah raang ih, Teesu mendi ngah ih sen suh dangdang ih baat rumhala: Rangmen lajatte loong likhiik lakah songtong theng, neng loong abah neng tenthun ah thaangmuh <verse number="18" style="v"/>nyia neng thung ah laamang ni. Erah loong abah Rangte ih koha roidong adi amuh, tiimnge liidi neng loong ah lajatte nyia neng tenthun ah jong ajaan tenthun. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Neng loong ah rakrek tenthun takah jeeka; eno neng roidong ah tiimthan ethih ekhah jeela erah di maakkaat rumla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kristo jiin nawa nyootsoot tan ah emah tah angka! <verse number="21" style="v"/>Sen ih Jisu tiit japchaat etan, eno heliphante ang anno Jisu jiin dowa amiisak ah nyootsoot etan. <verse number="22" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Kol 3:9</ref></char></note> Erah raangtaan ih, sen roidong ehak ah ehaat ih an—sen roidong ehak ah ebah hansi ramka ni songtong thuk tahan. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Sen tenthun mongtham ah ena jaatjaat ang theng, <verse number="24" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Rangph 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:10">Kol 3:10</ref></char></note> eno roidong ena ah kaptheng, erah roidong Rangte likhiik ih dongta, eno heheh ih ami tiit nyia esa ah dongjat thuk ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Jek 8:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Erah raangtaan ih tiit hu nakkah baat theng! Hanpiite wahoh damdoh amiisak tiit baat theng, tiimnge liidoh seng loong ah Jisu sakpuh ni esiit ih hoonli. <verse number="26" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Rsb 4:4</ref></char></note> Sen ten khah anbah uh, rangdah nah naktoom dat hoom han, eno henih nitang uh ten lakhat theng. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hakhoh Luuwang ah naknop thuk an. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Miputte angtan bah, mih put ah toihaat anno mootkaat thong mokah an, phanjangjang toom songtong an nyia changthih noodek toom jen chosok an. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Jengkhaap thih nakjeng an, erah nang ebah mih ih nookchaat theng jengkong an, mina tiimdi thoomramla eradoh senjeng senkong ah chaat hanno heh tarong theng toom ang ah. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Rangte Esa Chiiala ah nak thungthet thuk an; tiimnge liidi Rangte ah sen changte ngeh ih Chiiala ah changte wah sin, adoleh Rangte ih maama pongwan angthuk suh rangwu saakaan ah ethok jaatjaat ih thuk ha ngeh ih kamkam angtheng sin hoonha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ethih ekhah loong nawa, hansi ramka nawa, nyia tenkhat nawa haloh ang an. Sen jaachi nah lakah liilaangmui theng adoleh kaanjuumui theng adoleh lakah chiik haatmui theng. <verse number="32" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Kol 3:13</ref></char></note> Erah nang ebah, wasiit ih wasiit minchan muite nyia Kristo jun ih Rangte ih biin anaan hoon hali ah likhiik ih wasiit ih wasiit biin anaan jen hoonte ang theng.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Rangwu ni songtong tiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sen loong ah Rangte suh asah angphiino, sen uh heh likhiik angsuh sumthun ejih. <verse number="2" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Hpkt 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Rsb 40:6</ref></char></note> Sen loong roidong doh minchan eje ang theng, Kristo ih seng loong minchan heeno heh roidong kota ah likhiik ah, heh roidong ah phontum tingtak ah likhiik seng khojoop roop kota eno erah suh Rangte ah eroon ela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Sen loong ah Rangte mina angphiino, sen jaachi nah roomjup roomtong, ethih ekhah adoleh nyamnyook loong jeela ah tapunka ang ah. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Adoleh mih thetkhat jengkhaap, mih tam jengkhaap adoleh ethookchaat ettheng jengkhaap loong ah lajeng theng. Erah nang ebah Rangte suh lakookmi li an. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Sen ih jat ehan roomjup roomtongte, ethih ekhah mina, adoleh nyamnyook ramkaate (nyamnyook ah tongmih soomtuute thanthan) ah Rangte nyia Kristo Hasong nah tachoh wangka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>O ih uh lalangka jengkhaap nawa ih naktoom mokwaan han; heh jeng laboichaatte mina sak nah Rangte tenkhat raaha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Erah likhiik mina damdoh lajamwaan theng. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Sen teenuh teewah rangnak ni angtan, enoothong Teesu noksong ih hoon anno, sen loong ah rangwu ni. Erah raangtaan ih sen loong ah rangwu mih likhiik ih songtong an, <verse number="9" style="v"/>tiimnge liidi rangwu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangwu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah adi </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chiiala raangha</char></note> ah ih mathan ese, kateng, nyia amiisak tiit ah thoksiit hala. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Seng Teesu ah tiimjih suh roonla erah jat suh thun an. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mina loong ah lalang lajang reeraang rumla adoh sen roong reeraangjih tah angka, erah nang ebah neng loong ah rangwu nah doksiit an. (<verse number="12" style="v"/>Amiimiidi husah ni erah reeraang rumla ah rakmu riike jih.) <verse number="13" style="v"/>Eno neng husah ni reela loong ah rangwu nah angta no, neng dangjang ah wuusa nah dongjat thuk ah; <verse number="14" style="v"/>tiimnge liidi rangwu nah angta no jirep ah rangwu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14</char><char style="fq" closed="false">tiim ang abah uh rangwu nah angtaano rangwu singlanglang eh hoonla; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">jirep ah rangwu ih phaak thukla. </char></note> eh hoon ah. Erah raangtaan ih tiitthaak jeela,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Saat an, mokjupte loong,</para>
  <para style="q2">etek nawa esaat ih an,</para>
  <para style="q1">eno sen khothung nah Kristo ah phaak ah.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih rapniine ih songtong an. Tiim uh lajatte mina songtongla ah likhiik ih nak songtong an, erah nang ebah mongtham ese jatte likhiik eh songtong an. <verse number="16" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kol 4:5</ref></char></note> Sen saapoot ah mootse kaatse nah maak an, tiimnge liidi aanapja rangwu saakaan ah ethih. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, nak baang thaang an, seng Teesu ih tiim reethuk thung ah erah mokah an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kham ah jok anno nakmok an, erah ih bah anba thet haat ho, erah nang ebah, Chiiala damdoh tong an. <verse number="19" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">Kol 3:16-17</ref></char></note> Sen loong ah rangsoom boongkaat, seehoon damdoh roongwaan an; eno sen ten ih jam anno seng Teesu suh rangphoong rangsoom seehoon boongkaat ah se koh an. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Seng Teesu Jisu Kristo mendoh, seng Wah Rangte suh saarookwet lakookmi li an.</para>
  <para style="s">Hesanuh nyia hesawah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wasiit ih wasiit jeng chaatchaat eh an tiimnge liidoh sen ih Kristo soomtu han.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Ptr 3:1</ref></char>
    </note> Hesanuh loong, Teesu jeng chaatchaat elan ah likhiik sen sawah loong jeng chaatchaat e an. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tiimnge liidi, chaas tokkhodi Kristo chaan aphaan jeela ah likhiik hesanuh tokkhodi hesawah chaan aphaan ah jeela; eno heh sakpuh, chaas adi Kristo heh teeteewah ah chaas pangte. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, chaas heheh ih Kristo suh look haat koha ah likhiik hesanuh loong ah ih neng teenuh hesawah suh look haat kottheng.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Ptr 3:7</ref></char>
    </note> Hesawah loong, Kristo ih chaas ah minchan ano heh roidong kota ah likhiik sen sanuh ah minchan ih an. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kristo ih heh jengkhaap chaan nawa ih chaas ah esa ang thukla, eno ju nawa ih saachot ano saachamcham eh angla. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kristo ih erah reeta ah langla, chaas ah jaaseemoong—saachamcham tiimdi uh lamoong, amasah taan uh lamak adoleh jihoh tiim nah uh ethih angjih nak toom ang ah ngeh ih reeta. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Miwah ih neng sanuh ah neng sakpuh minchanha ah likhiik minchan theng. O miwah ih heh sanuh minchanha erah ih heh teeteewah minchanha. (<verse number="29" style="v"/>Seng teeteewah o ih uh tamiksukke. Erah nang ebah, Kristo ih chaas riikoi sokboiha ah likhiik sengteewah raangtaan ih jam phaksah hi adoleh riikoi sokboi hi; <verse number="30" style="v"/>tiimnge liidi seng loong ah sakpuh esiit ni roopli.) <verse number="31" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Rangph 2:24</ref></char></note> Rangteele ni amah liiha, “Erah raangtaan ih miwah ih henuh hewah ah thiinhaat ano hesanuh damdoh roongroop ah, eno enyi ah esiit ih hoon ah.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Rangteele adi husah tiit dongjat thuk ha—ngah ih Kristo nyia chaas tiit ah baat hang. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Enoothong aradi sen suh eli ih halan; hesawah warep ih hesanuh ah minchan jaatjaat etheng, eno hesanuh nurep ih hesawah ah choomjoot etheng.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Hesusah nyia henuwah loong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:20">Kol 3:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Hesusah loong, arah sen Kristaan loong mootkaatjih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mararah le ni raangmuh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">arah sen Kristaan loong mootkaatjih </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mararah le ni tajeeka</char><char style="ft" closed="false">arah Kristaan loong mootkaatjih</char></note>, sen ih sen nuwah loong jeng chaatchaat etheng, tiimnge liidoh punre eli aju arah. <verse number="2" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Hpkt 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Hodb 5:16</ref></char></note> “Sennuh senwah ah soomtu etheng” ah jaakhothoon jengdang erah ah kakham ni wakjeela: <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Tiimnge liidoh jirep ah sen damdam ese toom angha, eno arah hah adoh sen loong ah roidong eloh toom ih tong an.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:21">Kol 3:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Henuh hewah loong, sensuh sensah loong ah ekhat etheng nak liilaang an. Erah nang ebah, Kristaan dang ajang nyia reeraang lam ih renbaat anno hakpan theng.</para>
  <para style="s">Dah nyia changteewah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Kol 3:22-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Dah sen loong ah, sen changte wah ra mootcho damdoh hejeng chaatchaat ih re an; senten senmong ah koh anno Kristo mootkaat moh an rah likhiik ih moh an. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neng ih toomse chohe ngeh ih, neng miktup doh luulu nakre theng; erah nang ebah Kristo dah mamah angtheng ah erah sen ten ni Rangte ih tiimre theng liiha jun ih reetheng. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sen mootkaat pakna ah tenroon woksoon ih mokah an, mina raangtaan lah angthang ih Teesu mootkaat ngeh ih thun an. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Sen loong ah ih erah samthun an, dah angkojio adoleh mama pongwan ih tongte angkojio, mootse kaatse kali ah thaang Teesu ih jaasiit hethaang kot ehe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:1">Kol 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Hodb 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Kol 3:25</ref></char>
    </note> Changteewah loong, sen dah loong damdoh sen uh emamah ang theng, neng loong ah nak choophaan an. Sen ih erah samthun an, dah nyia heh changte loong changteewah ah rangmong ni tongla, heh ih wareprep ah phoosiitsiit ih dande ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Rangte lang apah loong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hethoon doh, Teesu damdoh roop an nyia hechaan hephaan nah rongtangtang ang an. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Sen loong ah Hakhoh Luuwang ethih phoong abe dowa jen pui suh, Rangte ih kotahan lang apah ah kap an. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tiimnge liidi seng loong ah mina damdi tamuike, seng muili abah rangwaatdam nawa chiiala ih panha ah damdi, ngoong awang damdi, nyia laamang roidong ni panha moong achaang damdi muili. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih Rangte ih koh halan lang apah ah amah dowa ih kap an. Eno juuba, ethih rangwu thok ha doh piiara ih thoklong han bah uh jen mui e an; raamui thoon lidoh nep sen rongtangtang jen chap an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref></char>
    </note> Erah raangtaan ih amiisak tiit ah, sen room ni roomkhe kheeha ah likhiik nyia kateng tiit ah laakkhoi likhiik ih toom ang ah, <verse number="15" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref></char></note> eno Ruurang Ese baattaan han ah sen lah ni lasong songhan arah likhiik ih toom ang ah. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Sen laalom ah laakkhoi likhiik; tiimnge liidoh Ethih warah ih we ih khaam ah likhiik wot ih haap handoh toom jen metmot an. <verse number="17" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref></char></note> Eno khopi roidong ah khopok likhiik ih kap an, nyia Rangte jengkhaap ah Chiiala ih koh halan lang ah likhiik toom ang ah. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Arah loong ah sen rangsoom nah Rangte jiin nawa suh an. Chiiala ih sen lam mamah siit han jirep raangtaan ih suh an. Arah tiit ah sen thung nah thunroh ih anno Rangte mina loong ah raangtaan rangsoom nah tong an. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Eno, husah ni jatthuk halang tiitkhaap ah baat chung adoh lacho laphaan ih baattaan suh Rangte ih kot toom ehang suh rangsoom kohe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Phaatak ni laang asak hang bah uh Ruurang ese raangtaan ih ngah roop chaplang. Ruurang ese ah mamah baat theng ah, erah lacho laphaan ih baat suh rangsoom kohe.</para>
  <para style="s">Lithoon Jengseera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Esm 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Tim 4:12</ref></char>
    </note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Kol 4:7-8</ref></char></note>Seng phono Taikikas, marah Teesu laksuh mootkaat ni laalomlom ih mootkaatte, warah ih nga tiit ah heh ih toombaat han, eno ngah mamah anglang erah jat an. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Erah thoidi, heh sen reeni kaat thuk halang—seng mamah tongli erah heh ih chobaat han adoleh sen suh chaankot jengkhaap ah jeng kohan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Seng loong Wah Rangte nyia seng Teesu Jisu Kristo ih semroongroong nyia laalomlom ih tong suh Kristaan minchan toom kohan. <verse number="24" style="v"/>O mina ih seng Teesu Jisu Kristo ah minchan ruh eha loong damdoh Rangte minchan toomje ah.</para>
</usx>
